WEBVTT

00:03.610 --> 00:06.150
This is all we managed to retrieve.

00:06.150 --> 00:08.750
We found it in the Guild's furnace.

00:08.750 --> 00:11.270
But most of it has been burned to ashes...

00:15.730 --> 00:17.210
This is...

00:17.620 --> 00:19.080
Is it some kind of token?

00:23.590 --> 00:25.960
Mahaeyzel Zelkoff.

00:26.980 --> 00:29.990
If we can find a way
to capture that man...

00:30.470 --> 00:32.790
I don't think that's possible.

00:32.790 --> 00:35.680
He might have already fled the city.

00:35.680 --> 00:37.070
Or perhaps...

00:42.020 --> 00:43.190
That's not allowed.

00:43.190 --> 00:45.400
I can't let him out.

00:45.400 --> 00:48.990
Yes, I completely understand.

00:48.990 --> 00:51.110
But the situation has changed.

00:51.560 --> 00:54.580
We have to make an exception
and let him out.

00:56.560 --> 00:58.410
Is this real?

00:58.410 --> 01:00.120
Of course.

01:00.120 --> 01:02.520
There's even a seal
from Galtuile here.

01:02.520 --> 01:05.880
The one in charge in the military
is quite reasonable.

01:05.880 --> 01:09.510
Oh, you can check all you want.

01:09.510 --> 01:12.220
However, locking up a hero like this

01:12.220 --> 01:14.510
isn't really much of a punishment, is it?

01:14.510 --> 01:19.390
Locking him in there is basically
just letting him sleep peacefully,

01:20.380 --> 01:21.850
right?

01:25.230 --> 01:27.780
Give me some time.
I'll go check.

01:27.780 --> 01:29.310
Please, go ahead.

01:41.080 --> 01:44.000
SENTENCED TO BE A HERO

03:05.250 --> 03:08.210
I want to go out, my knight.

03:08.650 --> 03:10.760
Don't you ever feel the same?

03:10.760 --> 03:13.730
You love zeff butter way too much.

03:13.730 --> 03:16.180
I cannot take this ban
on going out anymore.

03:16.180 --> 03:18.010
I want to go out!

03:19.050 --> 03:20.890
It's no use telling me that...

03:20.890 --> 03:22.600
Well then, Goddess.

03:22.930 --> 03:26.560
I recommend that you go
to the Dujin Art Museum.

03:27.200 --> 03:30.480
It has all kinds
of mid-century classical artifacts.

03:30.480 --> 03:34.900
The building itself was also built
with modern Nashida techniques.

03:34.900 --> 03:37.070
There's a lot to see.

03:37.070 --> 03:39.280
- Ioff City is a major shipping hub.
- Hmph.

03:39.280 --> 03:41.990
- It's full of all kinds of treasures.
- What's so fun about an art museum?

03:41.990 --> 03:43.950
If you want to take a walk,
go to the beach.

03:43.950 --> 03:46.540
The scenery is beautiful
when you fly over the coast.

03:47.010 --> 03:49.710
Flying into the forest
for a hunt is nice too.

03:49.710 --> 03:51.880
You're talking as if we can fly?

03:52.440 --> 03:55.590
Don't base everything on dragons.

03:56.050 --> 03:58.130
What? You got a problem with that?

03:58.130 --> 04:00.550
W-Well, we can go anywhere.

04:00.550 --> 04:02.220
Anyway, let us go into town.

04:02.220 --> 04:03.960
- I don't think that's possible.
- What?

04:03.960 --> 04:06.590
Did you forget we were attacked
in the city last time?

04:06.590 --> 04:08.640
The higher-ups won't allow it.

04:08.640 --> 04:11.520
What? No way...

04:11.520 --> 04:12.900
No.

04:12.900 --> 04:14.610
There's still a way to get permission.

04:14.610 --> 04:16.010
Really?

04:16.010 --> 04:18.399
Going to the Temple
shouldn't be a problem.

04:18.399 --> 04:19.910
It's very close to the barracks,

04:19.910 --> 04:22.330
so they can provide full protection.

04:22.330 --> 04:25.830
Kivia, you do say pleasant things
once in a while.

04:25.830 --> 04:27.540
Did something happen?

04:27.540 --> 04:29.830
Yes, that's quite rare.

04:29.830 --> 04:31.500
It's nothing...

04:31.500 --> 04:35.420
I only wanted to
cheer Lady Teoritta up.

04:35.420 --> 04:36.760
Exactly.

04:36.760 --> 04:39.430
Xylo, you should try
to cheer me up too.

04:39.430 --> 04:41.160
You actually said that yourself...

04:42.470 --> 04:43.390
Xylo...

04:43.930 --> 04:46.350
You should go greet
High Priest Marlen as well.

04:46.730 --> 04:49.810
I'll gather some trustworthy soldiers.

04:50.180 --> 04:51.580
Aren't you coming?

04:53.800 --> 04:55.360
I...

04:56.150 --> 04:57.300
have a lot to do.

04:59.010 --> 05:00.240
Got it.

05:00.240 --> 05:02.240
I'll take care of Teoritta.

05:07.160 --> 05:10.620
- Goddess!
- Lady Teoritta, Goddess of Swords!

05:10.620 --> 05:12.540
Please sign my book!

05:12.540 --> 05:14.340
Mine too!

05:14.340 --> 05:15.800
Leave it to me!

05:16.200 --> 05:20.800
The great Goddess Teoritta
will bestow blessings upon you all!

05:20.800 --> 05:21.970
Wonderful!

05:21.970 --> 05:24.510
- Then me too!
- Me too, Lady Teoritta!

05:24.510 --> 05:27.790
- They say the Goddess's autograph
- Lady Teoritta, my sister's too, please!

05:27.790 --> 05:28.930
- can ward off disaster,
- And my mom's too!

05:28.930 --> 05:31.190
- but people still believe in that.
- And my mom's too!

05:31.190 --> 05:33.230
Alright, once you get it signed,
move along.

05:34.730 --> 05:38.860
Goddess, please enjoy these.

05:38.860 --> 05:40.990
You're as small as my grandson,

05:40.990 --> 05:44.370
yet you're fighting the Demon Blight.

05:44.370 --> 05:45.830
Yes, that is absolutely right.

05:45.830 --> 05:47.450
I am great.

05:47.970 --> 05:49.410
What do you think, my knight?

05:49.410 --> 05:51.910
This is the Goddess's
long-cherished wish.

05:51.910 --> 05:53.870
Surely you feel quite proud as well.

05:53.870 --> 05:56.010
Oh, I will share my snacks
with you too.

05:56.010 --> 05:57.380
Thank you.

05:57.380 --> 05:59.550
- After all, I have to taste it for poison.
- Ah!

06:00.010 --> 06:02.330
- I'm sorry, Granny. I'll take it for now.
- Is that the Soaring Lightning?

06:02.330 --> 06:03.590
- I'm sorry, Granny. I'll take it for now.
- That Demon Lord Killer?

06:03.590 --> 06:06.180
That's Xylo Forbartz,
the Thunder Falcon.

06:06.180 --> 06:08.220
- I wonder if I can get his autograph.
- What?

06:08.220 --> 06:10.310
They know about me too?

06:10.310 --> 06:12.990
You're quite popular.

06:13.730 --> 06:15.380
High Priest Marlen...

06:16.400 --> 06:19.730
Your mission at Mureed Fortress
and your performance at Sodrick's Shell

06:19.730 --> 06:22.070
seem to have earned you
quite a bit of praise.

06:22.900 --> 06:25.070
I'm a penal hero, you know.

06:25.070 --> 06:27.690
- Ah, it's His Eminence!
- The children probably don't understand

06:27.690 --> 06:29.160
- E-Excuse us.
- the meaning of that yet.

06:29.160 --> 06:31.750
- Alright, let's go.
- I've changed my opinion of you too.

06:31.750 --> 06:32.660
Okay...

06:32.660 --> 06:35.290
I've heard a lot about you
from my niece.

06:37.000 --> 06:43.010
Patausche has a tendency to value honor
too highly and disregard her life.

06:43.800 --> 06:47.130
You could say she wants to be a hero.

06:47.720 --> 06:50.130
Don't you find that troublesome?

06:50.720 --> 06:51.930
Who knows...

06:52.430 --> 06:54.810
There are surprisingly
many people like that.

06:54.810 --> 06:57.830
Especially those
who fight the Demon Blight.

06:58.400 --> 07:00.920
As her uncle, it's normal
for you to be worried.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.230
Indeed...

07:02.230 --> 07:06.070
I treat Patausche like my own daughter.

07:06.570 --> 07:10.160
If anyone betrays her
and breaks her heart,

07:10.800 --> 07:12.030
I will never forgive them.

07:14.690 --> 07:16.620
Listen, Xylo Forbartz.

07:16.620 --> 07:18.970
Although you seem to have a fiancée...

07:19.920 --> 07:22.090
- What is it?
- This bell...

07:22.880 --> 07:23.800
Tch.

07:23.800 --> 07:25.550
Xylo, what happened?

07:25.550 --> 07:26.660
It's an enemy attack.

07:27.090 --> 07:30.050
The enemy has invaded Ioff City.

07:30.430 --> 07:32.250
We're under attack.

07:41.650 --> 07:44.150
Ah, what a coincidence.

07:44.520 --> 07:46.780
What are you doing here?

07:47.280 --> 07:51.450
Well, I noticed an error
in the report I submitted,

07:51.450 --> 07:53.870
so I must revise it right away...

07:53.870 --> 07:58.360
Many important military
and Temple documents are kept here.

07:58.360 --> 08:01.020
Only officers are allowed to enter.

08:01.020 --> 08:02.990
Ah, is that so?

08:02.990 --> 08:05.970
Then I apologize for barging in
without knowing the rules.

08:07.510 --> 08:10.470
We're in combat.
Get out of here!

08:10.470 --> 08:13.560
Alright, alright.
I'll gather the hero unit right away.

08:13.910 --> 08:17.080
If possible, please don't mention
that we met here...

08:34.990 --> 08:39.559
Also, think about me. I'm the one who has
to make fake permits every time...

08:39.559 --> 08:40.390
Tch.

08:41.610 --> 08:43.130
Oh, Xylo.

08:44.630 --> 08:46.590
Hey, Comrade Xylo.

08:47.090 --> 08:49.430
I'm glad to see you so full of energy.

08:49.430 --> 08:52.720
You seemed busy while I was away.

08:52.720 --> 08:55.680
Even in the punishment room,
my heart ached for you.

08:55.680 --> 08:58.390
I see you still have
that fake smile on your face.

08:58.760 --> 09:02.560
This is the Goddess, right?

09:04.020 --> 09:06.480
Nice to meet you, Lady Teoritta.

09:06.480 --> 09:08.280
I'm Rhyno,

09:08.280 --> 09:12.490
the artilleryman for Penal Hero Unit 9004.

09:12.490 --> 09:15.660
Comrade Xylo and I
are like partners, right?

09:15.660 --> 09:16.730
Tch.

09:16.730 --> 09:18.330
We're not, okay?

09:18.700 --> 09:20.040
- Hey, Venetim!
- Yikes.

09:20.040 --> 09:22.520
Don't you think
it's too early to let him out?

09:22.520 --> 09:24.630
Just looking at his face
makes my blood boil!

09:24.630 --> 09:25.540
Huh?

09:25.540 --> 09:27.760
Weren't you the one
who told me to get him out?

09:27.760 --> 09:31.420
You volunteered to be a penal hero,
but ended up in the punishment room...

09:31.420 --> 09:33.050
What exactly are you trying to do?

09:33.470 --> 09:36.850
I merely wish to dedicate myself
to the vulnerable people

09:36.850 --> 09:38.890
who are being ravaged by the faeries.

09:38.890 --> 09:41.520
What happened in the last operation
was unavoidable.

09:41.880 --> 09:45.440
You call firing a cannon
at a civilian home unavoidable?

09:45.900 --> 09:47.360
What are you even talking about?

09:47.360 --> 09:48.480
Alright, alright.

09:49.070 --> 09:53.740
Anyway, let's now work together
and overcome this challenge.

09:55.120 --> 09:55.950
Now then...

09:56.660 --> 09:58.910
Ioff Cheg in the Port District.

09:58.910 --> 10:01.790
The faeries seemed to have appeared here.

10:02.290 --> 10:04.760
After that,
the horde of faeries began to move.

10:05.710 --> 10:08.920
They came to Tui Jia
and occupied this coral tower.

10:08.920 --> 10:09.870
Tch.

10:09.870 --> 10:12.050
Isn't that an important
coastal defense facility?

10:15.220 --> 10:17.840
Among the faerie horde is the Demon Lord.

10:17.840 --> 10:20.630
There's a possibility that Tui Jia
has been turned into a faerie.

10:21.060 --> 10:22.480
- That's a decoy.
- It's a decoy.

10:22.970 --> 10:23.580
Tch.

10:24.480 --> 10:26.710
The enemy has artillery too, right?

10:26.710 --> 10:28.940
Judging from the current
wind direction and speed,

10:28.940 --> 10:32.490
they can bombard
all of Ioff Cheg from Tui Jia.

10:32.990 --> 10:35.780
In other words, they're holding
the entire area hostage?

10:36.490 --> 10:38.400
What are Galtuile's orders?

10:38.400 --> 10:40.950
Uh... about that...

10:40.950 --> 10:43.000
They've requested
the Thirteenth Order of the Holy Knights

10:43.000 --> 10:46.570
and the Ioff City Defense Force
be deployed in the Inland District,

10:46.570 --> 10:50.420
with the hero unit defending
the Port District.

10:50.420 --> 10:51.380
What?!

10:51.930 --> 10:54.250
They want us to hold out
until reinforcements arrive

10:54.250 --> 10:57.430
before launching a counterattack.

10:57.890 --> 10:59.340
Wait until reinforcements arrive?

10:59.340 --> 11:01.970
So they're leaving
the Port District civilians to die?

11:01.970 --> 11:03.890
The N-Noble Alliance probably wants

11:03.890 --> 11:06.100
to prioritize defending
the Inland District.

11:06.100 --> 11:10.070
After all, the inland area contains
the main institutions and the nobles' assets.

11:11.070 --> 11:13.570
Damn it! They only care
about protecting themselves?

11:14.250 --> 11:15.130
Um...

11:15.780 --> 11:20.080
I think it's pointless to get hurt
or die in a battle like this.

11:20.080 --> 11:20.870
What?

11:20.870 --> 11:24.290
P-Perhaps it's better not to
get too actively involved...

11:24.830 --> 11:26.750
How brazen of you, Venetim.

11:27.180 --> 11:29.000
No matter how dire the situation is,

11:29.000 --> 11:32.710
we are the only ones
who can save the civilians now.

11:33.080 --> 11:36.010
This is a fight
worth risking our lives for.

11:36.800 --> 11:39.760
Hey, don't risk your life so easily.

11:39.760 --> 11:41.890
As expected of our Goddess.

11:41.890 --> 11:44.430
What a beautiful resolve.

11:44.430 --> 11:46.770
I completely agree.

11:46.770 --> 11:50.170
Comrade Xylo,
now's the time for us to fight.

11:50.170 --> 11:54.360
Let's join hands and do our best
for the people's future and hope!

11:54.360 --> 11:55.530
Shut up.

11:55.530 --> 11:57.320
It's just work, after all.

11:57.320 --> 12:00.280
Xylo, I know you can definitely do it.

12:00.280 --> 12:02.280
I believe in you.

12:03.870 --> 12:04.790
Alright.

12:05.250 --> 12:08.040
I won't let things go the way
those bastards want.

12:09.070 --> 12:11.140
Do not underestimate us.

12:14.630 --> 12:16.390
We'll build a bunker here.

12:16.390 --> 12:18.680
It'll be a refuge for the civilians.

12:18.680 --> 12:22.510
Erect the sacred seal barricade
according to my blueprint.

12:22.510 --> 12:23.540
Yes!

12:23.540 --> 12:25.640
Next, build a fire.

12:25.640 --> 12:29.020
Collect sacred seal-infused cookware
and food.

12:29.020 --> 12:30.100
Yes!

12:30.100 --> 12:33.020
Hey, why are those guys
from the Guild here?

12:33.020 --> 12:36.260
Apparently, His Majesty said
he'd introduce them to new jobs.

12:36.260 --> 12:39.190
He also said he'd give them
salaries and official posts.

12:39.190 --> 12:40.490
Official posts...

12:41.070 --> 12:43.370
Start by gathering wood.

12:43.370 --> 12:45.160
Bring as much as you can!

12:45.160 --> 12:45.740
Yes, sir!

12:46.080 --> 12:49.670
- Hurry up! Don't dawdle!
- Well, it's better than being bandits.

13:01.090 --> 13:03.100
It is very hot, but it is delicious.

13:03.100 --> 13:04.350
Hey, Tatsuya.

13:05.140 --> 13:06.280
You should eat too.

13:08.810 --> 13:10.770
Idiot, don't eat with your hands!

13:11.660 --> 13:13.230
He is in a hurry to eat.

13:13.230 --> 13:15.770
No, you're spilling the soup too...

13:18.780 --> 13:21.660
Eating hot food will keep your morale up.

13:22.600 --> 13:25.620
You actually started
by setting up a cooking station.

13:25.620 --> 13:27.410
As expected of Comrade Norgalle.

13:27.410 --> 13:28.830
Impressive.

13:29.370 --> 13:32.000
Th-That is some incredible equipment.

13:32.000 --> 13:34.230
That's a Neven Artillery Seal Compound.

13:34.760 --> 13:38.550
But no one knows
why he's got this old-fashioned armor.

13:40.800 --> 13:44.070
I thought this would be our
first full-team battle in a while.

13:44.070 --> 13:48.020
Comrades Tsav and Jayce can't deploy?

13:48.640 --> 13:51.020
Tsav is still treating his arm.

13:51.020 --> 13:53.130
But given the current situation,

13:53.130 --> 13:55.800
I had him receive minimal treatment,
and he's on his way here.

13:55.800 --> 13:56.980
Ow!

13:56.980 --> 13:58.680
What about Comrade Jayce?

13:58.680 --> 14:00.940
Didn't they get permission to deploy?

14:01.320 --> 14:03.790
Venetim is helping with the negotiations.

14:03.790 --> 14:07.620
It's too dangerous to deploy
a flying dragon in the city,

14:07.620 --> 14:08.660
but we'll find a way.

14:09.120 --> 14:11.120
His Majesty can't leave the base.

14:11.540 --> 14:14.330
Dotta also needs to know
how the battle is going.

14:14.790 --> 14:17.290
The four of us will go to Tui Jia.

14:17.290 --> 14:18.730
In other words,

14:19.630 --> 14:22.010
we're completely understaffed.

14:22.720 --> 14:25.640
Then, may I make a suggestion?

14:27.640 --> 14:29.060
Let's hear it.

14:29.640 --> 14:32.140
Let's blow up this wall with artillery.

14:32.600 --> 14:34.940
If we let the faeries invade
the Inland District,

14:34.940 --> 14:37.860
soldiers other than us
will also be forced to fight.

14:38.220 --> 14:40.070
The manpower shortage will be solved.

14:40.610 --> 14:41.320
Huh?

14:42.320 --> 14:46.120
Hardship and suffering
should be shared by everyone.

14:46.120 --> 14:49.910
That's how humans deepen their bonds.
That's what makes them precious.

14:50.870 --> 14:53.410
My knight, this man...

14:53.410 --> 14:54.950
I know...

14:55.420 --> 14:56.670
Rejected.

14:56.670 --> 14:59.290
Don't put civilians in danger, idiot.

14:59.290 --> 15:00.280
Hmm?

15:00.280 --> 15:03.380
Or do you have a better idea,
Comrade Xylo?

15:03.380 --> 15:04.550
Rhyno.

15:04.550 --> 15:07.850
It's not bonds
that drive ordinary people to act.

15:07.850 --> 15:09.260
It's self-interest.

15:10.140 --> 15:13.000
Bombard the ships docked in the harbor.

15:13.000 --> 15:15.740
With your ability, you should
be able to hit them from here.

15:16.230 --> 15:18.440
I see. Understood.

15:18.440 --> 15:20.310
As expected of Comrade Xylo.

15:20.310 --> 15:21.690
Next,

15:22.070 --> 15:23.360
we need to take that place.

15:23.900 --> 15:27.610
We'll suppress Tui Jia
and kill the Demon Lord there.

15:36.710 --> 15:39.800
Commander Kivia, please issue
the orders for this mission.

15:39.800 --> 15:42.250
Yes, I'm on my way.

15:45.670 --> 15:48.310
No matter how I look at it,
it's a ridiculously stupid order.

15:48.310 --> 15:49.890
It can't be helped.

15:49.890 --> 15:52.180
Support from the nobles is essential.

15:52.180 --> 15:55.850
Besides, there are many
Temple-related buildings in this area.

15:56.890 --> 15:59.860
Oh, I'm sorry to bother you.

15:59.860 --> 16:01.210
What is it?

16:01.210 --> 16:04.820
Didn't the hero unit receive
the order to deploy?

16:04.820 --> 16:10.200
Yes, as their commander,
I'll ensure they fight bravely.

16:11.160 --> 16:13.490
However, I heard
the docked sacred seal vessels

16:13.490 --> 16:16.500
were attacked by faeries.

16:16.500 --> 16:17.660
What did you say?

16:17.660 --> 16:21.930
We cannot afford to lose
any of the Temple's assets right now.

16:21.930 --> 16:25.460
So I'd like permission
to deploy the dragon.

16:25.460 --> 16:26.630
Impossible!

16:26.630 --> 16:29.720
Why would faeries attack
the sacred seal vessels first...

16:29.720 --> 16:30.890
Reporting!

16:30.890 --> 16:33.600
A large sacred seal vessel is on fire!

16:33.600 --> 16:34.330
What...

16:35.390 --> 16:38.250
There's been a rescue request
from the Temple.

16:40.440 --> 16:42.310
Good work.
You're dismissed.

16:42.310 --> 16:42.860
Yes!

16:46.320 --> 16:47.450
I see.

16:47.450 --> 16:49.150
It seems what you said is true.

16:49.150 --> 16:50.530
So that's really the case?

16:50.910 --> 16:54.330
When I first heard about it,
I couldn't believe my ears either.

16:54.330 --> 16:56.290
It's truly unfortunate.

16:58.690 --> 16:59.960
I understand.

17:00.340 --> 17:02.080
Permission granted to deploy the dragon.

17:02.080 --> 17:02.970
Commander!

17:02.970 --> 17:05.960
If the Temple has requested it,
then it's justified.

17:05.960 --> 17:08.250
We'll also mobilize
our troops immediately.

17:08.250 --> 17:11.180
Thank you for your understanding.

17:11.180 --> 17:12.760
Oh, one more thing.

17:12.760 --> 17:16.220
Please send my regards
to High Priest Marlen.

17:18.020 --> 17:20.440
You! What are you trying to say?

17:20.440 --> 17:22.400
Huh? No, I was just—

17:22.400 --> 17:23.980
Why did you mention my uncle?

17:23.980 --> 17:25.609
What are you implying?

17:25.609 --> 17:27.819
No... that's not it.
I didn't...

17:29.150 --> 17:33.120
My uncle, High Priest Marlen,
is a great man!

17:33.120 --> 17:35.410
He devoted himself to the Temple

17:35.410 --> 17:38.250
and did everything to support
the Holy Knights and me.

17:38.250 --> 17:41.210
How dare you treat such
a great man like that...

17:41.210 --> 17:43.420
No... that's not it.

17:43.420 --> 17:44.840
Actually, it's... that.

17:45.430 --> 17:47.090
How should I put it...?

17:47.090 --> 17:50.170
I'd like to suggest tightening security
in the underground waterways...

17:56.470 --> 17:57.430
Tsk.

18:03.980 --> 18:05.310
Run!

18:05.310 --> 18:06.650
Not that way!

18:06.650 --> 18:07.940
Go to the shelter!

18:10.070 --> 18:11.820
Xylo, they're charging from the front!

18:11.820 --> 18:12.760
Bogies!

18:12.760 --> 18:14.700
They're closing in from the right too!

18:14.700 --> 18:18.010
Good. Keep monitoring the situation.

18:18.790 --> 18:19.620
They're coming!

18:22.330 --> 18:24.000
This is really...

18:24.540 --> 18:26.960
Bogies are the bane of artillery.

18:26.960 --> 18:28.960
Comrade Xylo, I'm counting on you.

18:28.960 --> 18:30.170
I know.

18:38.390 --> 18:40.470
We're going in too, Teoritta!

18:40.470 --> 18:41.270
Yes.

18:41.770 --> 18:43.690
I give you my blessing!

18:54.360 --> 18:56.490
Get blown to bits!

18:59.080 --> 19:02.370
Just as I thought. In life,
you have to ally yourself with the heroes.

19:02.370 --> 19:04.370
I couldn't be happier.

19:05.420 --> 19:07.880
We're going in!
Straight to Tui Jia in one push—

19:07.880 --> 19:08.880
Wait!

19:09.270 --> 19:11.210
There's a warehouse in front of you.

19:11.210 --> 19:15.130
Um, it has the Verkle Development
Corporation's logo on it.

19:15.130 --> 19:16.720
There's a campfire over there.

19:16.720 --> 19:18.680
It looks like someone is hiding inside.

19:18.680 --> 19:20.560
The faeries have surrounded it too.

19:20.560 --> 19:22.600
It's become a shelter?

19:22.600 --> 19:24.270
Damn, what a hassle.

19:24.270 --> 19:26.770
Now, what should we do,
Comrade Xylo?

19:27.190 --> 19:31.000
Xylo, this is a great and honorable fight.

19:31.940 --> 19:32.980
I...

19:33.690 --> 19:34.950
I know.

19:41.910 --> 19:42.660
Tch.

19:44.540 --> 19:47.460
Rhyno, I'm going to have you work
like your life depends on it.

19:47.460 --> 19:48.500
So brace yourself!

19:48.500 --> 19:49.460
Of course.

19:50.840 --> 19:52.750
For the sake of complete strangers,

19:53.800 --> 19:55.740
I'm willing to sacrifice myself.

19:58.010 --> 19:59.720
This is getting interesting.

20:09.600 --> 20:10.990
Mm.

20:19.740 --> 20:22.040
Breaking flash seal hit confirmed.

20:22.040 --> 20:24.830
We really are a great team, aren't we?

20:25.170 --> 20:27.330
Especially you, Goddess Teoritta.

20:27.330 --> 20:29.290
Your power is outstanding.

20:29.290 --> 20:31.250
Y-Yes.

20:31.250 --> 20:35.420
But somehow, it is hard to accept
a compliment from you...

20:37.590 --> 20:40.180
You don't have to be so wary of me.

20:40.180 --> 20:42.350
We're not that different, you know.

20:42.350 --> 20:43.970
You two are nothing alike, okay?

20:44.640 --> 20:47.020
The Holy Knights should
be making their move soon.

20:47.020 --> 20:48.560
Isn't that right, Venetim?

20:48.560 --> 20:50.650
Huh? Oh, yes.

20:50.650 --> 20:53.410
I finally convinced them
to let Jayce deploy.

20:53.410 --> 20:55.650
I also had them block
the underground waterways.

20:55.650 --> 20:56.530
The waterways?

20:56.990 --> 20:58.430
Have they been invaded?

20:58.430 --> 21:01.360
No. Things were urgent then,
so I made it up.

21:01.870 --> 21:03.830
Made it up? You...

21:03.830 --> 21:06.030
No, I think it's a good idea.

21:06.030 --> 21:08.540
We should strengthen security in the city.

21:09.080 --> 21:12.540
Frenci and the men from night-gaunt
are on guard in the city.

21:12.540 --> 21:14.580
After all, we still have
Spriggan to deal with.

21:14.580 --> 21:15.590
Whoa, Xylo!

21:15.590 --> 21:18.220
Straight ahead! On the roof!

21:18.220 --> 21:19.800
This is bad!

21:19.800 --> 21:20.680
What?

21:20.680 --> 21:22.470
What's bad?

21:26.060 --> 21:28.020
Oh my, are those lightning staffs?

21:28.020 --> 21:30.020
I can't believe they can use sacred seals.

21:30.020 --> 21:31.350
Are you serious?

21:31.350 --> 21:33.100
Are the coexisters behind this?

21:33.560 --> 21:34.310
Rhyno!

21:35.650 --> 21:37.030
I see.

21:48.200 --> 21:50.430
Mm, I'm unharmed.

21:50.430 --> 21:53.170
But my luminescence is a little low.

21:55.880 --> 21:58.460
I was gonna slip into an alley
to dodge their beams, but...

21:58.460 --> 22:01.050
I don't think we have time
to take a detour.

22:01.050 --> 22:01.760
Hey, stop—

22:13.060 --> 22:16.060
Th-The civilians' homes have been...

22:16.060 --> 22:19.280
Yes, saving lives comes first.

22:19.690 --> 22:21.570
That's not the point...

22:22.240 --> 22:23.780
Alright, let's go.

22:24.280 --> 22:26.660
To the trapped civilians!

22:27.120 --> 22:28.830
- Go!
- Annihilate them!

22:31.330 --> 22:33.370
Don't let them invade
the Inland District!

22:33.370 --> 22:34.870
Fire!

22:37.250 --> 22:39.550
All right, they're the last ones.

22:39.550 --> 22:40.800
Fire!

22:42.670 --> 22:45.050
It's been sealed off?

22:45.680 --> 22:50.100
The plan was for the faeries to invade
through the underground waterways.

22:50.100 --> 22:52.680
Excellent tactical insight.

22:53.270 --> 22:55.200
I respect that.

22:55.880 --> 22:57.650
What's going on?
There's something here.

22:57.650 --> 22:58.770
Is it a faerie?

22:59.190 --> 23:00.650
What? A human?

23:00.650 --> 23:02.740
Who are you?
What are you doing there?

23:03.110 --> 23:06.950
Everyone, I hope you don't resist.

23:07.490 --> 23:10.790
It would be too pitiful
to die in pain.

23:32.400 --> 23:33.560
Uncle!

23:33.560 --> 23:35.020
Patausche.

23:35.020 --> 23:36.600
You're here.

23:36.600 --> 23:39.400
I heard there are faeries
in the Inland District too...

23:39.400 --> 23:42.530
Yes, the guards reported it to me.

23:42.530 --> 23:44.990
It seems they invaded through
the underground ruins.

23:55.620 --> 23:58.010
The military and the Temple
are working together...

23:58.630 --> 24:01.210
Uncle, did you organize
the soldiers yourself?

24:01.210 --> 24:04.210
After all, this is not the time for us
to turn against each other.

24:04.760 --> 24:07.130
If I can't get the two groups
to work together,

24:07.130 --> 24:09.180
what's the point of me
being the High Priest?

24:09.890 --> 24:11.260
Let's use this crisis

24:11.260 --> 24:14.180
to strengthen the unity
between the military and the Temple.

24:14.600 --> 24:19.200
Such a bond will lead
humanity to victory.

24:20.110 --> 24:21.360
Uncle...

24:23.530 --> 24:26.570
Your ambition truly inspires me.

24:27.030 --> 24:29.420
I'm counting on you, Patausche.

24:29.420 --> 24:31.830
Let's overcome this trial together.

24:32.160 --> 24:32.870
Yes.

24:33.660 --> 24:34.500
Mm.

24:38.710 --> 24:42.210
May the blessings
of Saint Mahaeyzel be with us.

24:44.790 --> 24:47.310
All right, we're switching
from defense to offense.
